		(property "Notes" "BTP_INT level shift onto the shared open-drain IRQ_N (inverts: IRQ_N low while BTP_INT is high). AO3400A Vgs(th) 0.65-1.45 V against BTP_INT VOH >= 1.8 V at 10 uA (DS 7.12); JLC basic, same part as Q104. Firmware: BTP_POL = 1 whenever BTP_EN = 1 (review 4 D-2)"
